<view wx:if="{{missing}}" class="page"
  ><view class="title">这是一张示例邀请</view
  ><view class="subtitle"
    >跨设备邀请尚未接入。请先在本机体验创建一个项目。</view
  ><button class="btn section" bindtap="decline">前往首页</button></view
><view wx:else="" class="page with-dock welcome"
  ><view class="welcome-leaf"
    ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/leaf.svg" /></view
  ><view class="title large"
    >你收到了一份<text class="line-break">{{'\n'}}</text>特别的礼物</view
  ><view class="subtitle">TA想听听你的人生故事，把它写成一本书。</view
  ><view class="letter section"
    ><view class="small muted">来自{{p.buyer}}的心意</view
    ><view class="letter-body serif"
      >{{p.recipient}}，<text class="line-break">{{'\n'}}</text>想更了解你，<text
        class="line-break"
      >
      </text
      >也想把你的故事<text class="line-break">{{'\n'}}</text>留给我们。</view
    ><view class="letter-heart"
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/heart.svg" /></view></view
  ><view class="welcome-steps section"
    ><view
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/mic.svg" /><text
        >说一段往事</text
      ></view
    ><view
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/clipboard-check.svg" /><text
        >确认你的故事</text
      ></view
    ><view
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/book-open.svg" /><text
        >珍藏成一本书</text
      ></view
    ></view
  ><view class="participation note"
    >你的讲述、照片和故事会与赠礼的子女共享。哪些内容入书，由你决定；你可以暂停或退出。</view
  ><button class="check-row" bindtap="agree"
    ><view class="check-box {{agreed?'on':''}}"
      ><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/check-light.svg" /></view
    ><text>我了解并愿意参与，保存我的讲述与照片</text></button
  ><button class="link" bindtap="privacy">查看完整资料与隐私说明</button></view
><view wx:if="{{!missing}}" class="dock"
  ><button class="btn" disabled="{{!agreed}}" bindtap="accept"
    >开始讲我的故事
    <image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/arrow-right-light.svg" /></button
  ><button class="link" bindtap="back">暂时不参加</button></view
>
